      "bodySample": "[{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Yabai! Fukushuu Yami Site 2\",\"search_titles\":\"Yabai! Fukushuu Yami Site 2 Dangerous! Revenge - Website of Darkness Yabai! Fukushuu Yami Site ヤバい! -復讐・闇サイト- 위험해! -복수・암흑 Site-\",\"slug\":\"yabai-fukushuu-yami-site-2\",\"description\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA mysterious fire and a bullied girl committing suicide led her brother (Ryou Tezuka) to take matters into his own hands.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003eKidnapping three girls -- Yukawa Ayano, Inami Misuzu, and Tsubaki Rina -- he rapes and tortures them to extract information on why they had to bully his sister?  Why did she have to die?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003eMisuzu Inami is a model that does well, Ayano Yukawa works as an actress in public entertainment, and Tsubaki Rina seemed to be his younger sister's best friend.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThere is also the mystery of a journal hiding a dark past...\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"views\":3171571,\"cover_url\":\"https://hanime-cdn.com/images/covers/yabai-fukushuu-yami-site-2-cv3.png\",\"poster_url\":\"https://hanime-cdn.com/images/posters/yabai-fukushuu-yami-site-2-pv1.jpg\",\"brand\":\"Suzuki Mirano\",\"brand_id\":92,\"likes\":8028,\"dislikes\":181,\"downloads\":128749,\"tags\":[\"bondage\",\"virgin\",\"anal\",\"toys\",\"blow job\",\"censored\",\"ahegao\",\"horror\",\"filmed\",\"big boobs\",\"school girl\",\"facial\",\"scat\",\"cosplay\",\"hd\"],\"created_at_unix\":1399380969,\"released_at_unix\":1398384005,\"created_at\":\"2014-05-06T12:56:09.000Z\",\"released_at\":\"2014-04-25T00:00:05.000Z\"},{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"Yabai! Fukushuu Yami Site 1\",\"search_titles\":\"Yabai! Fukushuu Yami Site 1 Dangerous! Revenge - Website of Darkness Yabai! Fukushuu Yami Site ヤバい! -復讐・闇サイト- 위험해! -복수・암흑 Site-\",\"slug\":\"yabai-fukushuu-yami-site-1\",\"description\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA mysterious fire and a bullied girl committing suicide led her brother (Ryou Tezuka) to take matters into his own hands.\\u