introduce \\r\\n\\r\\nUrara to the lab master, Majima.\\r\\n\\r\\nThen in a luxurious and grossly decorated room, Majima can't stop licking his lips \\r\\n\\r\\nogling the sexy Urara. He tells her she being chosen by god, and that she must \\r\\n\\r\\nenter the seminar to obtain answers.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cb"
